# Files kept in the repo but never sent to visitors.
#
# Named explicitly rather than by wildcard. An earlier "images/*.JPG" here was
# matched case-insensitively and silently excluded all seventeen lowercase
# .jpg diagrams, so every reconstruction page rendered a broken image on the
# deployed site while working perfectly in local preview.
#
# The page requests 21 files from images/: the six .webp and fifteen .jpg
# listed nowhere below. Everything below is source material or a working
# master that nothing on the page links to.

build-trail.py
wrangler.jsonc
.assetsignore
.DS_Store
.claude/*

# Original reconstruction diagrams, superseded by the recon-*.jpg exports
images/ComboHybrid.png
images/DIEP.png
images/Direct.png
images/FatGrafting.png
images/FlatClosure.png
images/IGAP.png
images/LAT.png
images/NippleAreola.png
images/PAP.png
images/SGAP.png
images/TEtoIMPLANT.png
images/TUG.png

